`
			},
			checks: [
				{ id: 'pick-exists', kind: 'exists', selector: '#pick' },
				{ id: 'no-blanks', kind: 'text', selector: '#pick', matches: '^[^…]*$' },
				{ id: 'options', kind: 'count', selector: '#options tr.opt', min: 3 },
				{ id: 'fit-words', kind: 'text', selector: '#options td.fit', matches: '^\\s*(?:[Yy]es|[Nn]o|[Mm]aybe|[Pp]artly|[Ii]n part)' },
				{ id: 'choice', kind: 'text', selector: '#choice', matches: 'Wix|Squarespace|Webflow|Shopify|WordPress|Tilda|Bitrix|[Bb]uilder' },
				{ id: 'reason-action', kind: 'field', selector: '#reason', field: 'mainAction.label' },
				{ id: 'reason-items', kind: 'field', selector: '#reason', field: 'items[].title', min: 1, when: { brief: 'items[].title' } },
				{
					id: 'pd-where',
					kind: 'text',
					selector: '#pd',
					matches: '(?=[\\s\\S]*\\S+\\s+\\S+\\s+\\S+\\s+\\S+)(?=[\\s\\S]*(?:server|platform|host|cloud|region|data cent|email|CRM|spreadsheet|United States|EU\\b))'
				},
				{ id: 'consent-page', kind: 'text', selector: '#consent', matches: '[Cc]onsent|[Pp]rivacy|[Pp]olicy|[Nn]otice|[Pp]ersonal' },
				{ id: 'cost-rows', kind: 'count', selector: '#cost tr.line', min: 4 },
				{ id: 'cost-numbers', kind: 'text', selector: '#cost td.sum', matches: '^\\s*\\$?\\d[\\d,\\s]*\\s*$' },
				{
					id: 'exit-plan',
					kind: 'text',
					selector: '#exit',
					matches: '(?=[\\s\\S]*\\S+\\s+\\S+\\s+\\S+\\s+\\S+)(?=[\\s\\S]*(?:[Ee]xport|[Dd]ownload|[Tt]ake|[Cc]opy|[Cc]ode|HTML|[Mm]ove|[Mm]igrat|[Kk]eep|[Rr]emain|[Ss]tay))'
				}
			]
		},
		quiz: [
			{
				type: 'single',
				prompt: 'What is a “block builder” such as Wix, Squarespace or Tilda?',
				options: [
					'A service where a site is put together in the browser from ready-made blocks (a cover, text, a form), with no programming',
					'A program you install on your own server and write code for',
					'A markup language for pages'
				],
				answer: 0,
				why: [
					'Yes. The blocks adapt to a phone on their own, and for anything unusual there is a free-layout tool (Tilda calls it Zero Block) where elements are dragged into place.',
					'No: that describes a CMS such as WordPress or 1C-Bitrix.',
					'No: the markup is HTML, and a builder only writes it for you.'
				]
			},
			{
				type: 'single',
				prompt: 'Who needs a store platform’s link to accounting or stock software (in Russia, 1C-Bitrix’s exchange with 1C)?',
				options: [
					'Someone whose stock, prices and orders are kept in accounting software, and who needs the catalog and orders to flow to the site and back',
					'Someone making a three-page brochure site',
					'Everyone who has an inquiry form'
				],
				answer: 0,
				why: [
					'Yes. A store with a big catalog and no link to the books turns into typing every price and stock level twice.',
					'No: a brochure site has no products and no stock, so it needs no exchange.',
					'No: an inquiry form has nothing to do with accounting software.'
				]
			},
			{
				type: 'single',
				prompt: 'Are “Bitrix24” and “1C-Bitrix: Site Manager” the same thing?',
				options: [
					'No: Site Manager is a CMS for sites and stores, while Bitrix24 is a separate product, a CRM and workspace for a company',
					'Yes, they are two names for one program',
					'No: Bitrix24 is an older version of the site system'
				],
				answer: 0,
				why: [
					'Yes. The names are alike and the jobs differ. When someone says “Bitrix”, ask which one. It is the same trap as WordPress.com and WordPress.org.',
					'No: they are different products of one company.',
					'No: Bitrix24 is not a version of the site system but a separate system.'
				]
			},
			{
				type: 'multiple',
				prompt: 'What is worth finding out about a builder before you build a site on it?',
				options: [
					'Whether the site’s code can be exported, and on which plan',
					'Where inquiry data is stored and what the platform promises about protecting personal data',
					'What happens to the site if you stop paying the subscription',
					'What color the platform’s logo is'
				],
				answer: [0, 1, 2],
				why: [
					'Yes: that decides whether you can ever leave.',
					'Yes: as the site’s owner you answer for visitors’ personal data, while the platform stores it.',
					'Yes: on a builder the site usually lives only as long as the subscription is paid.',
					'No: it has nothing to do with the decision.'
				]
			},
			{
				type: 'single',
				prompt: 'A three-screen landing page with an inquiry form, edited by the owner, on a small budget. What is most likely to fit?',
				options: ['A builder such as Squarespace or Wix', 'A store platform with accounting links', 'A homemade engine written from scratch'],
				answer: 0,
				why: [
